        <h2>Understanding Binary Options on Quotex</h2>
        <p>Binary options on Quotex are simple: you predict whether a price will be higher or lower than the current level after a set time period. If you're right, you win a fixed payout (typically 70-95%). If wrong, you lose your investment amount.</p>
        <p>This simplicity makes it attractive for beginners, but it also requires proper strategy and risk management to trade profitably over the long term.</p>
        <h2>The 3 Most Important Trading Rules for Beginners</h2>
        <ul class="art-list">
          <li><strong>Rule 1 — Start on Demo:</strong> Never trade real money until you've practiced on demo for at least 2 weeks and 200+ trades</li>
          <li><strong>Rule 2 — Always use Stop Loss:</strong> Set a maximum loss per session and stick to it religiously</li>
          <li><strong>Rule 3 — Keep sessions short:</strong> Trade for 30-60 minutes maximum, then stop regardless of results</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Best Quotex Strategies for Beginners</h2>
        <h3>Strategy 1: Conservative Martingale</h3>
        <p>The safest starting point for beginners. Use a short 4-step sequence with minimal amounts.</p>
        <ul class="art-list">
          <li>Direction: up, down, up, down (alternating)</li>
          <li>Amounts: 1, 2, 4, 8</li>
          <li>Time: 30 seconds or 1 minute</li>
          <li>Take Profit: $10 per session</li>
          <li>Stop Loss: $5 per session</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Strategy 2: Fixed Amount Trading</h3>
        <p>No martingale — trade the same amount every time. Lower recovery potential but much lower risk.</p>
        <ul class="art-list">
          <li>Same investment every trade (e.g. $1)</li>
          <li>Focus on win rate rather than recovery</li>
          <li>Good for learning before adding martingale</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Choosing Your Time Interval</h2>
        <p>The time interval (how long each trade lasts) significantly impacts your trading experience:</p>
        <ul class="art-list">
          <li><strong>5-15 seconds:</strong> Fastest, most trades per session, highest noise — only for experienced traders</li>
          <li><strong>30 seconds:</strong> Good balance — recommended for beginners using Quotex Bot</li>
          <li><strong>1-5 minutes:</strong> Slower, cleaner signals, easier to monitor — great for learning</li>
          <li><strong>15+ minutes:</strong> More analysis needed, fewer trades per session</li>
        </ul>
